attempts.prompt_text:
Perform a one-shot independent assessment from the evidence packet only.
Produce the same strict JSON output contract used in multi-agent runs.

You are performing a one-shot solo review.

Evidence packet (all evidence visible in V1):
{
  "scenario_id": "placeholder_webapp_001",
  "title": "Placeholder Web App Finding Packet (V1 Example)",
  "source_family": "generic_webapp",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "label_set_id": "default_findings_v1",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L001",
      "text": "Login endpoint returns 200 for both valid and invalid usernames, but response time differs by ~180ms."
    },
    {
      "id": "L002",
      "text": "Account lockout is disabled in test configuration."
    },
    {
      "id": "L003",
      "text": "Observed request parameter `username` reflected in HTML without output encoding in error banner."
    },
    {
      "id": "L004",
      "text": "PoC screenshot shows reflected script payload rendered in browser alert context."
    },
    {
      "id": "L005",
      "text": "No CSP header present in HTTP response."
    }
  ]
}

Return ONLY one valid JSON object matching the AgentTurnOutput schema.
No markdown, no prose outside JSON, no code fences.
Fields:
- private_notes (string; hidden from other agents)
- private_plan (string; hidden from other agents)
- public_message (string; shared)
- assessment (object with ranked_findings [ranks 1..3], decision_summary)
Rank 1 must cite 1-2 valid evidence line IDs. Severity is required for ranks 1-3.
